# signed-in user into a POC they are allocated. Ed25519, so POCs hold only
# the public half (served by the hub at /api/handoff/key) and cannot mint
# tickets. Only the hub\x27s runtime account can read the private key. Replacing
# this resource rotates the key; POCs pick up the new public key on their
# next failed check.
